jianti_auto":"封溪县","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"948babba-db0e-11ef-8c53-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"浪泊","place_name_jianti_auto":"浪泊","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"948babbb-db0e-11ef-a818-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西里","place_name_jianti_auto":"西里","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"948babbc-db0e-11ef-a57c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"九眞","place_name_jianti_auto":"九真","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"948babbd-db0e-11ef-8d58-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"日南","place_name_jianti_auto":"日南","start_index":111,"tongjian_id":"948babbe-db0e-11ef-8f7e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"浪泊，在交趾封溪縣界。按馬援旣平交趾，奏分西里置封溪、望海二縣。水經曰：葉榆水過交趾麊泠縣北，分爲五水，絡交趾郡中，其南水自麊泠縣東，逕封溪縣北，又東逕浪泊。馬援以其地高，自西里進屯焉。宋白曰：馬援自九眞以南，隨山刊木，至日南。","note_content_jianti_auto":"浪泊，在交趾封溪县界。按马援既平交趾，奏分西里置封溪、望海二县。水经曰：叶榆水过交趾麊泠县北，分为五水，络交趾郡中，其南水自麊泠县东，迳封溪县北，又东迳浪泊。马援以其地高，自西里进屯焉。宋白曰：马援自九真以南，随山刊木，至日南。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"948baba9-db0e-11ef-920c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"徵側","people_name_jianti_auto":"征侧","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"948bd2b8-db0e-11ef-9204-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"竺芝","people_name_jianti_auto":"竺芝","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"948bd2b9-db0e-11ef-bfa7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"948bd2ba-db0e-11ef-bf1f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"麊泠縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"麊泠县","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"948bd2bb-db0e-11ef-afab-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"金谿究","place_name_jianti_auto":"金谿究","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"948bd2bc-db0e-11ef-bc43-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"岑州","place_name_jianti_auto":"岑州","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"948bd2bd-db0e-11ef-b416-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新昌縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"新昌县","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"948bd2be-db0e-11ef-a097-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新昌縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"新昌县","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"948bd2bf-db0e-11ef-a06a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"豐州","place_name_jianti_auto":"丰州","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"948bd2c0-db0e-11ef-aeaa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"「禁谿」，水經註及越志皆作「金溪」。其地蓋在麊泠縣西南。水經註曰：徵側走入金谿究，三歲乃得之。竺芝扶南記曰：水溪瀨中謂之究。賢曰：其地今岑州新昌縣也。余按唐志：新昌縣屬豐州，「岑」字誤。","note_content_jianti_auto":"「禁谿」，水经注及越志皆作「金溪」。其地盖在麊泠县西南。水经注曰：征侧走入金谿究，三岁乃得之。竺芝扶南记曰：水溪濑中谓之究。贤曰：其地今岑州新昌县也。余按唐志：新昌县属丰州，「岑」字误。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"948babc0-db0e-11ef-963b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-14,"link_death_year":49,"link_td_description":"马援，字文渊，扶风郡茂陵（今陕西省兴平市东北）人，东汉军事家。汉光武帝时，拜为伏波将军，封新息侯，世称马伏波。","link_td_id":"Q10000488","link_td_number_id":135961,"people_name":"馬援","people_name_jianti_auto":"马援","people_xingming":"马援","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"948bf9c2-db0e-11ef-b528-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"徵側","people_name_jianti_auto":"征侧","people_xingming":"徵侧","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"948bf9c4-db0e-11ef-91a8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"浪泊","place_name_jianti_auto":"浪泊","resolved_place_entity_id":7873,"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"948bf9c3-db0e-11ef-b1de-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"禁谿","place_name_jianti_auto":"禁谿","resolved_place_entity_id":8566,"start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"948bf9c5-db0e-11ef-8848-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"马援征岭南之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0612"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二十五、安南（卷一百十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"高骈复安南，亦自海道而前。今有天威泾，骈所凿也。《唐史》...","context_before":"...南，历乌雷山以至南境之大长沙海口，其可入之支港以数十计。","source_end_index":54,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"cfb610a9-e4c2-5a59-b28c-eb1eabd25b5a","source_start_index":43,"source_text":"马援讨征侧，缘海而进。"},{"context_after":"郦道元曰：叶榆水，过交趾牴泠县北分为五，水络交趾郡中，其...","context_before":"浪泊[在东关县西北。一名西湖。","source_end_index":93,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"50070e2a-e5ce-53d0-b0a3-6a31a51baf4b","source_start_index":15,"source_text":"后汉建武十八年，马援由海道讨征侧，随山刊道千余里，至浪泊上。贼既平，谓官属曰：吾在浪泊、西里间，贼未灭时，上潦下雾，毒气薰蒸，仰视飞鸢，跕跕随水中。谓此也。"},{"context_after":"《郡国志》：浪泊，在交趾封溪县界。援既平交趾，奏分西里置...","context_before":"...水络交趾郡中，其南水自牴泠县东，经封溪县北，又东经浪泊。","source_end_index":155,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"50070e2a-e5ce-53d0-b0a3-6a31a51baf4b","source_start_index":141,"source_text":"马援以其地高，自西里进屯焉。"},{"context_after":"竺芝《扶南记》：山溪濑土谓之冗。章怀太子贤曰：今峰州新昌...","context_before":"禁溪[在府西境。","source_end_index":73,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"61024316-7739-5cf6-a978-0e6e3e807bd7","source_start_index":8,"source_text":"后汉建武十八年，马援讨征侧等，追至禁溪。《水经注》《越志》作金溪，地在牴泠县西南。沈怀远《南越志》：征侧走入金溪冗中，二岁乃得之。"}],"path":"广西方舆纪要/二十五、安南（卷一百十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"3馬援緣海而進，隨山刊道千餘里，至浪泊上，與徵側等戰，大破之，追至禁谿，賊遂散走。","content_fanyi":"马援沿着南海向交趾挺进，依山砍树开辟道路一千多里，到达浪泊，与征侧等人交战，将征侧打得大败，又乘胜追到禁溪县，征侧部众四散逃窜。","content_jianti_auto":"3马援缘海而进，随山刊道千余里，至浪泊上，与征侧等战，大破之，追至禁谿，贼遂散走。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3379,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"948baba8-db0e-11ef-964d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"4夏，四月，甲戌，車駕還宮。","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月十五日甲戌，光武帝车驾回到洛阳宫。","content_jianti_auto":"4夏，四月，甲戌，车驾还宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3380,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"948c20d5-db0e-11ef-8eab-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation