"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"8吳漢發廣漢、巴、蜀三郡兵，圍成都百餘日，秋，七月，拔之，斬史歆等。漢乃乘桴沿江下巴郡，楊偉等惶恐解散。漢誅其渠帥，徙其黨與數百家於南郡、長沙而還。","content_fanyi":"吴汉征调广汉、巴、蜀三郡的兵力，包围成都一百多天，秋季七月，攻占成都，斩杀史歆等人。吴汉于是率军乘着竹木筏，沿长江顺流而下，直达巴郡，杨伟等人恐惧不安，纷纷解散部众。吴汉诛杀了他们的首领，将党徒数百家迁徙到南郡、长沙郡，然后班师。","content_jianti_auto":"8吴汉发广汉、巴、蜀三郡兵，围成都百余日，秋，七月，拔之，斩史歆等。汉乃乘桴沿江下巴郡，杨伟等惶恐解散。汉诛其渠帅，徙其党与数百家于南郡、长沙而还。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3384,"number":8,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"948c6f35-db0e-11ef-8266-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"948cd1f0-db0e-11ef-9d58-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"宜城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"宜城县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"948cd1f1-db0e-11ef-a798-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"南郡","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"948cd1f2-db0e-11ef-ad34-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"948cd1f3-db0e-11ef-ac9b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄢邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"鄢邑","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"948cd1f4-db0e-11ef-9984-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄州","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄州","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"948cd1f5-db0e-11ef-a7e6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"率道縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"率道县","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"948cd1f6-db0e-11ef-b8fa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：宜城縣，屬南郡，楚之鄢邑也，故城在今襄州率道縣南。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：宜城县，属南郡，楚之鄢邑也，故城在今襄州率道县南。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"948cd1ef-db0e-